  // When the same standing rule reaches the Coolangatta, Palm Beach and
  // Burleigh Heads rows it will read oddly there and those rows likely need
  // an exception.
  description:
    'House deep cleaning services across the Northern Rivers and the Tweed. A one-off, room-by-room reset. Published task list, quoted before we start.',
  // Domain still a placeholder, same as the other pages — confirm before launch.
  canonical: 'https://tlbcleaning.com.au/deep-cleaning/',
